%% 页面切换流程（App + AnimatePresence + PageTransition）
sequenceDiagram
  participant U as 用户
  participant App as App.tsx
  participant A as AnimatePresence
  participant PT as PageTransition
  participant P as 目标页面

  U->>App: 点击导航 (RouterLink)
  App->>App: useLocation() 变化
  App->>A: <Routes key=pathname>
  A->>PT: 旧页 exit (opacity 0, y -8)
  A->>PT: 新页 initial (opacity 0, y 12)
  PT->>PT: animate (opacity 1, y 0, 0.3s easeOut)
  PT->>P: 渲染页面内容
  Note over App,P: 路由 path 一字未改

%% 按钮水滴 ripple 流程（LiquidButton）
sequenceDiagram
  participant U2 as 用户
  participant LB as LiquidButton
  participant M as motion.span
  participant B as MUI Button

  U2->>LB: pointerdown
  LB->>LB: 计算 x/y/size (相对 rect)
  LB->>M: 插入 ripple (key++)
  M->>M: initial {scale:0, opacity:.45}
  M->>M: animate {scale:1, opacity:0} 0.6s
  M-->>LB: onAnimationComplete
  LB->>LB: 移除该 ripple (filter key)
  LB->>B: 原生 onClick 仍触发（disableRipple）
